        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoop Fighters</strong> is a multiplayer, local-coop <strong>rule-free party basketball game</strong> with cartoon graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can beat up your friends or other players while making scores in lobbies which you can create up to 6 people or you can create local lobbies up to 4 people, Hoop Fighters supports <strong>Steam Remote Play</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.poster.avif?t=1782389919\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.webm?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.mp4?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can punch, slide or even throw objects around your opponent to get the ball.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local coop supports bots, you can play against bot or with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/aa35bc40d8620b86a955ca254c726dbd.avif?t=1782389919\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras_big/aa35bc40d8620b86a955ca254c726dbd.webp?t=1782389919 width=1560 height=866 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to run to the ball again after scoring because <strong><i>the game never stops!</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/e7a161c88c761f016650f3a94f572193.poster.avif?t=1782389919\" width=554 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/e7a161c88c761f016650f3a94f572193.webm?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/e7a161c88c761f016650f3a94f572193.mp4?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your place in the most unregulated and funny basketball game to show off your basketball skills, have unlimited fun and beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.poster.avif?t=1782389919\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.webm?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.mp4?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the character that reflects your mood best and jump onto the court.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoop Fighters</strong> is a multiplayer, local-coop <strong>rule-free party basketball game</strong> with cartoon graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can beat up your friends or other players while making scores in lobbies which you can create up to 6 people or you can create local lobbies up to 4 people, Hoop Fighters supports <strong>Steam Remote Play</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.poster.avif?t=1782389919\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.webm?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.mp4?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can punch, slide or even throw objects around your opponent to get the ball.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local coop supports bots, you can play against bot or with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/aa35bc40d8620b86a955ca254c726dbd.avif?t=1782389919\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras_big/aa35bc40d8620b86a955ca254c726dbd.webp?t=1782389919 width=1560 height=866 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to run to the ball again after scoring because <strong><i>the game never stops!</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/e7a161c88c761f016650f3a94f572193.poster.avif?t=1782389919\" width=554 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/e7a161c88c761f016650f3a94f572193.webm?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/e7a161c88c761f016650f3a94f572193.mp4?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your place in the most unregulated and funny basketball game to show off your basketball skills, have unlimited fun and beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.poster.avif?t=1782389919\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.webm?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.mp4?t=1782389919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the character that reflects your mood best and jump onto the court.</p>",
        "short_description": "Knock down your opponents and smash their hoops! Hoop Fighters is an online, no-rules party basketball game for up to 6 players multiplayer or up to 4 player local coop. Slide into opponents, throw punches or objects at them. Do your best to get the ball. Remember, there are no rules!",
